OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1793290764
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ADetails of thousands of US immigration
OL,4,Aagents leaked in major hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FWednesday's leak marks the third time
OL,7,Fin recent weeks that a government
OL,8,Fagency has been targeted by leaks or
OL,9,Fhacks.
OL,11,FA DHS spokesperson said the agency is
OL,12,F"aware of a potential breach and is
OL,13,Factively working to address the
OL,14,Fsituation swiftly and effectively."
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
