OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AMicrosoft profits soar days after
OL,4,Aannouncing thousands of layoffs
OL,5,
OL,6,FLike many other major tech firms,
OL,7,FMicrosoft is investing heavily in the
OL,8,Finfrastructure that powers AI even as
OL,9,Fquestions remain over whether such huge
OL,10,Fspending will pay off.
OL,12,FMicrosoft shares rose by almost 2.9% in
OL,13,Fafter hours trading in New York on
OL,14,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
