OL,3,ARow over George Michael items up for
OL,4,Aauction - including Faith guitar
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family row has broken out over an
OL,7,Fauction of George Michael memorabilia
OL,8,Ftaking place on Thursday.
OL,10,FThe guitar the singer-songwriter
OL,11,Fperformed with in the Faith music video
OL,12,Fis one of several items being auctioned
OL,13,Fby Sworders from the collection of
OL,14,FSiobhan Bailey, Michael's long-time
OL,15,Fpersonal assistant.
OL,17,FSiobhan died in 2014 and the items are
OL,18,Fbeing sold by her estranged husband Ian
OL,19,FBelcher, who inherited them after her
OL,20,Fdeath.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11913
SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1793290764
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARow over George Michael items up for
OL,4,Aauction - including Faith guitar
OL,5,
OL,6,FGerard Bailey, Siobhan's brother, told
OL,7,Fthe BBC she "would be horrified at the
OL,8,Fprospect of the auction being held in
OL,9,Fher name and that her personal,
OL,10,Fcherished possessions are being sold
OL,11,Foff to the highest bidder". Both
OL,12,FSworders and Belcher declined to
OL,13,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
